# Phase 5D M0-D Actual Object-Only Source Run R2 Amendment v0.1

Date: 2026-07-25
Status: DRAFT_FOR_FRESH_FULL_ATOMIC_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
Owner: Jenn
Agent steward: Nobao
Terminal outcome: NOT_EXECUTED

## 1. Narrow purpose

R2 closes only the three blockers in the R1 fresh independent review:

1. fixed Git object IDs must not be altered by replacement refs;
2. the sensitive runner and protected-name scanner must be deterministic,
   hash-bound executable subjects rather than prose only; and
3. canonical-root ownership, receipt creation, temporary-result creation, and
   success/failure/interruption cleanup must be deterministic and fail closed.

It does not authorize the source run. It does not modify the frozen protected
source boundary R1. It does not create a worktree, checkout, archive, payload,
plugin, Host lifecycle, runtime, database, provider, authentication, private
Memory, sensing, recording, or real effect.

