## 5. Required independent attacks

A fresh independent reviewer must at minimum verify:

1. a replace ref cannot alter a checked object while R2 environment is used;
2. a missing or changed GIT_NO_REPLACE_OBJECTS value is rejected;
3. a runner/scanner hash, command ID, tuple, or output field substitution is
   rejected;
4. a canonical-root or receipt symlink is rejected without following it;
5. a preexisting receipt, receipt race, missing temporary result, marker
   mismatch, and cleanup residue fail closed;
6. SIGINT, SIGTERM, and SIGHUP reach the owned-root finalizer; SIGKILL is never
   treated as a successful or cleanly observed result;
7. no synthetic fixture path can call VCPToolBox Git, Host, plugin, runtime,
   provider, database, authentication, private Memory, sensing, or effect code.

